{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for trying out our relaxing cat care mini-game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo version, you can interact with two adorable cats. Use drag-and-drop tools to clean, groom, care for, and even give them a stylish manicure. Completing each full care routine unlocks a Lofi-style illustration, accompanied by soothing background music to create a calm and cozy corner just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple click-and-drag mechanics and no time limits or scoring, this game is perfect for a short, peaceful break from your busy day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re working on adding more cats, decorative items, and interactive scenes. We'd love to hear your feedback and suggestions\u2014what interactions do you enjoy, and what features would you like to see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy a warm and relaxing moment in this gentle little world, together with your feline companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920640/extras/e41b8c789d0fab9645ff403863355390.poster.avif?t=1754470885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920640/extras/e41b8c789d0fab9645ff403863355390.webm?t=1754470885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920640/extras/e41b8c789d0fab9645ff403863355390.mp4?t=1754470885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920640/extras/fd2d53419eb92248055000ebac27ad88.poster.avif?t=1754470885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920640/extras/fd2d53419eb92248055